			"notes": "## Created with the MCreator\n![VPM Logo](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f5d9c48481d27f0f88827ed437b4b37cef6f5008.jpeg)\n\n# This Mod adds some Basic and Vanilla friendly Machines\n\n![Picture of the Machines](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0920fe921ba3b30958ab90b44ef6d9e5becfdf65_0.webp)\n\n## Observer Piston\nThis block watches in front and back for Kelp, Cactus, Bamboo and Sugarcane and cuts it off. You can also observe one Block above\n\n## Babysorter\nThis block seperates the Babies from Adults\nPig, Cow\n\n## Concrete Mixer\nThis Block can be filled with a Bucket of Water\nThen you can Rightclick with Concretepowder and receive solid Concrete.\n\n## Tripple Furnace\nBasicly that what it sounds like. Burnspeed like an normal Furnace but have 3 Slots\n\nFeel free to use it in any Modpack"
		}
